     "partnerReply": {
      "reply": "Thank you for your honest feedback.\n\nWe’re glad you found the location convenient, but we’re very sorry that the cleanliness and condition of the property did not meet your expectations. Having to clean the room yourself or fix a bathroom door handle is certainly not the experience we want for our guests.\n\nWe also appreciate your comments regarding the difference between the property condition and the photos online. We’ll review this with our operations and housekeeping teams and look into the condition of the facilities and the accuracy of our current photos.\n\nThank you for bringing these issues to our attention. We’re sorry we fell short during your stay and appreciate your feedback as it helps us identify areas that need improvement."
     },
