     "reviewedDate": 1784024703,
     "partnerReply": {
      "reply": "We’re very sorry that we did not meet your expectations.\n\nThank you for taking the time to provide such detailed feedback. While we’re glad you appreciated our location and the dinner team, we sincerely apologise for the condition of the room and shared areas you experienced.\n\nThe cleanliness issues you described, including the cigarette butts, gum, hair, stains, and condition of the room and kitchen, are not the standard we want our guests to experience. We also understand your concerns regarding the difference between the advertised photos and the condition you found upon arrival.\n\nWe take this feedback seriously and will raise these concerns with our housekeeping and operations teams for review. We will also review the room presentation and listing photos to ensure they accurately represent the current condition of our property.\n\nWe’re sorry that your stay with us was disappointing, and we appreciate you bringing these matters to our attention. We hope we can use your feedback to improve the experience for future guests."
     }
